Subject: Forward input to the host only while the stream's VT is in front

On the Pi the stream runs on tty2 and pi-console-keys switches to a text
console with Ctrl+Alt+F3..F6 while the stream keeps running. SDL 2.32 keeps
reading the evdev devices while its VT is in the background and posts no
focus event, so everything typed on the Pi console also reached the host.
Check VT_GETSTATE on stdin (the unit's TTYPath) and drop key presses,
mouse motion / buttons / wheel and gamepad input while another VT is in
front. Releases still pass so nothing held across the switch stays stuck.

